  "WHY US",
  "Local execution capabilities.",
  "Regulatory",
  "Entering the Saudi market offers significant opportunity.",
  "But it also requires deep local knowledge, regulatory navigation, and trusted commercial relationships.",
  "BuildTrade provides international companies with a structured and efficient pathway to establish and scale their presence in the Kingdom.",
  "Our model removes the typical barriers associated with market entry by combining local execution capabilities, regulatory readiness, and disciplined commercial development.",
  "Local Market Access",
  "We provide direct access to the Saudi market through our local presence, sector-focused teams, and established commercial networks.",
  "Importer-of-Record Platform",
  "BuildTrade acts as the legal importer-of-record, managing regulatory compliance, customs procedures, and logistics.",
  "Scalable Market Sector Expertise",
  "Our activities focus on sectors aligned with national priorities and strong long-term growth potential, including construction, industry, energy, agri-tech, healthcare, and advanced manufacturing.",
  "No Local Entity Required",
  "International partners can commercialize their products in Saudi Arabia without immediately establishing a local company, reducing risk, cost, and complexity.",
  "Scalable Market Development",
  "We combine market intelligence, lead generation, client acquisition, and ongoing account management to build sustainable revenue streams.",
  "Trusted International Partnerships",
  "Through our collaboration with organizations such as IDM South Tyrol, we connect international innovation ecosystems with Saudi market demand"
 ],
